#: include/variables.php:40
msgid ""
"If checked Intropage displays important (errors, warnings) information first"
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet är markerat visas viktig information (fel och varningar) "
"först på Intropage"

#: include/variables.php:196
msgid ""
"How many days before a scheduled maintenance schedule should a warning be "
"displayed?"
msgstr "Hur många dagar före ett schemalagt underhåll ska en varning visas?"

#: include/variables.php:223 include/variables.php:230
#: include/variables.php:237 include/variables.php:244
#: include/variables.php:251 include/variables.php:258
#: include/variables.php:265 include/variables.php:272
#: include/variables.php:279 include/variables.php:286
#: include/variables.php:293 include/variables.php:300
#: include/variables.php:307
msgid ""
"If this event has occurred, trigger the selected Normal, Warning, or Alert "
"status color."
msgstr ""
"Om händelsen har inträffat används den valda statusfärgen för normal, "
"varning eller larm."

#: include/variables.php:325
msgid ""
"The ratio of failed availability checks to successful checks to trigger as "
"Warning or Alert status color."
msgstr ""
"Förhållandet mellan misslyckade och lyckade tillgänglighetskontroller som "
"utlöser statusfärgen för varning eller larm."

#: include/variables.php:336
msgid ""
"Ping latency above these levels will trigger a Warning or Alert status "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Ping-svarstider över dessa nivåer utlöser statusfärgen för varning eller "
"larm."

#: panellib/alert.php:38
msgid "Host alerts (up/down/recovering) in last 30 minutes"
msgstr "Värdlarm (uppe/nere/återhämtning) under de senaste 30 minuterna"
